{"seq":1,"slug":"ci-optimization-monorepo","title":"CI 优化策略：分片、并行与增量构建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/scaling/ci-optimization-monorepo","wordCount":988,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"ci-优化策略-分片-并行与增量构建\">CI 优化策略：分片、并行与增量构建</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CI 分片（Sharding）</td>\n<td>将测试/构建任务拆分到多个并行 job 上执行，缩短总时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量构建（Incremental Build）</td>\n<td>只重新构建受影响的包，跳过未变更包的构建和测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行度（Parallelism）</td>\n<td>同一 CI job 内同时运行的任务数，受 CPU 核心数限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布式缓存</td>\n<td>Remote Cache 配合多个 CI runner 共享构建产物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>matrix 策略</td>\n<td>GitHub Actions 的矩阵构建，用于在多个环境或分片上并行运行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键路径（Critical Path）</td>\n<td>任务 DAG 中耗时最长的串行链，决定 CI 总耗时下限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"monorepo-ci-的性能挑战\">Monorepo CI 的性能挑战</h2><p>随着 Monorepo 规模扩大，CI 会面临严峻的性能挑战：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>全量构建时间增长</strong>：每增加一个包，CI 时间相应增加</li>\n<li><strong>资源浪费</strong>：改动一个包但运行所有包的测试，浪费 90% 以上的 CI 时间</li>\n<li><strong>开发者等待时间过长</strong>：CI 慢会降低代码审查效率和发布频率</li>\n<li><strong>成本增加</strong>：CI 时间与费用直接挂钩，尤其是付费 CI 平台</li>\n</ul>\n<p>优化策略按优先级排序：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>增量构建 + 受影响分析</strong>（效果最显著，10-100x）</li>\n<li><strong>Remote Cache</strong>（消除重复构建，2-10x）</li>\n<li><strong>任务并行化</strong>（充分利用 CPU，2-4x）</li>\n<li><strong>CI 分片</strong>（横向扩展，2-8x）</li>\n<li><strong>构建工具优化</strong>（使用原生构建工具，1.5-3x）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"增量构建策略\">增量构建策略</h2><p>增量构建是 CI 优化最核心的手段，本质是&quot;只做必要的工作&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"pnpm-filter-turborepo-组合\">pnpm filter + Turborepo 组合</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# GitHub Actions&#10;- name: Build and test affected packages&#10;  run: |&#10;    turbo run build test --filter=&#39;...[origin/${{ github.base_ref }}]&#39;&#10;  env:&#10;    TURBO_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.TURBO_TOKEN }}&#10;    TURBO_TEAM: ${{ vars.TURBO_TEAM }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GitHub Actions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Build and test affected packages</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    turbo run build test --filter='...[origin/${{ github.base_ref }}]'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    TURBO_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.TURBO_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    TURBO_TEAM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ vars.TURBO_TEAM }}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"nx-affected-组合\">Nx affected 组合</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- name: Run affected tasks&#10;  run: |&#10;    nx affected -t build test lint \\&#10;      --base=origin/${{ github.base_ref }} \\&#10;      --head=HEAD \\&#10;      --parallel=3&#10;  env:&#10;    NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Run affected tasks</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    nx affected -t build test lint \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      --base=origin/${{ github.base_ref }} \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      --head=HEAD \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      --parallel=3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN }}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"增量构建的正确-git-checkout-配置\">增量构建的正确 git checkout 配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;  with:&#10;    fetch-depth: 0 # 必须：拉取完整历史供 diff 分析&#10;    # 或使用更精细的历史深度（仅在 fetch-depth: 0 太慢时使用）&#10;    # fetch-depth: 100\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    fetch-depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 必须：拉取完整历史供 diff 分析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 或使用更精细的历史深度（仅在 fetch-depth: 0 太慢时使用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # fetch-depth: 100</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"任务并行化\">任务并行化</h2><h3 id=\"同一-runner-内并行\">同一 Runner 内并行</h3><p>Turborepo 和 Nx 默认就会最大化并行执行无依赖的任务：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Turborepo：默认并行执行（无需额外配置）&#10;turbo build test lint&#10;&#10;# Nx：通过 --parallel 控制并行度&#10;nx affected -t build test lint --parallel=3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Turborepo：默认并行执行（无需额外配置）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Nx：通过 --parallel 控制并行度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> affected</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lint</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --parallel=3</span></span></code></pre></div><p>并行度建议：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Runner 配置</th>\n<th>推荐 <code>--parallel</code></th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2 vCPU</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>避免 CPU 过载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4 vCPU</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>留一核给系统进程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8 vCPU</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>高内存消耗任务（如 TS 编译）适当降低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ci-分片策略\">CI 分片策略</h2><p>当单个 Runner 的并行度已经充分利用，但 CI 时间仍不满足要求时，引入 CI 分片——将任务横向分布到多个 Runner。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基于-matrix-的手动分片\">基于 matrix 的手动分片</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"jobs:&#10;  test:&#10;    strategy:&#10;      matrix:&#10;        shard: [1, 2, 3, 4]&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          fetch-depth: 0&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - name: Get affected packages&#10;        id: affected&#10;        run: |&#10;          PACKAGES=$(nx show projects --affected --base=origin/main --json)&#10;          echo &quot;packages=$PACKAGES&quot; &gt;&gt; $GITHUB_OUTPUT&#10;&#10;      - name: Run tests for this shard&#10;        run: |&#10;          # 将包列表按 matrix.shard 分片&#10;          nx affected -t test \\&#10;            --base=origin/main \\&#10;            --shard=${{ matrix.shard }}/${{ strategy.job-total }} \\&#10;            --parallel=2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    strategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      matrix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        shard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          fetch-depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Get affected packages</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">affected</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          PACKAGES=$(nx show projects --affected --base=origin/main --json)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          echo \"packages=$PACKAGES\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Run tests for this shard</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          # 将包列表按 matrix.shard 分片</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          nx affected -t test \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --base=origin/main \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --shard=${{ matrix.shard }}/${{ strategy.job-total }} \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            --parallel=2</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Nx 原生支持 <code>--shard=M/N</code> 语法，将受影响包按 hash 均匀分配到 N 个分片中。</p>\n<h3 id=\"nx-cloud-分布式任务执行-推荐\">Nx Cloud 分布式任务执行（推荐）</h3><p>Nx Cloud 的 DTE 方案更优雅，无需手动管理分片逻辑：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"jobs:&#10;  agents:&#10;    name: Agent ${{ matrix.agent }}&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    strategy:&#10;      matrix:&#10;        agent: [1, 2, 3, 4]&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - run: pnpm install&#10;      - run: npx nx-cloud start-agent&#10;        env:&#10;          NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN }}&#10;&#10;  main:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          fetch-depth: 0&#10;      - run: pnpm install&#10;      - run: npx nx-cloud start-ci-run --distribute-on=&quot;4 linux-medium-js&quot;&#10;        env:&#10;          NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN }}&#10;      - run: nx affected -t build test lint --base=origin/main --parallel=3&#10;      - run: npx nx-cloud stop-all-agents&#10;        if: always()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  agents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Agent ${{ matrix.agent }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    strategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      matrix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        agent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#2