     - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          fetch-depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx nx-cloud start-ci-run --distribute-on=\"4 linux-medium-js\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.NX_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">nx affected -t build test lint --base=origin/main --parallel=3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx nx-cloud stop-all-agents</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">always()</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;Main Runner\\n触发 nx affected&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Nx Cloud 调度层\\n分析任务图,分配任务&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Agent Runner 1\\n执行 build@utils\\nbuild@ui&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;Agent Runner 2\\nbuild@web\\ntest@utils&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;Agent Runner 3\\ntest@ui\\nlint@all&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;聚合结果\\n反馈给 Main Runner&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F\">graph TD\n    A[\"Main Runner\\n触发 nx affected\"] --&gt; B[\"Nx Cloud 调度层\\n分析任务图,分配任务\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Agent Runner 1\\n执行 build@utils\\nbuild@ui\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"Agent Runner 2\\nbuild@web\\ntest@utils\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"Agent Runner 3\\ntest@ui\\nlint@all\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"聚合结果\\n反馈给 Main Runner\"]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"缓存与构建产物管理\">缓存与构建产物管理</h2><h3 id=\"remote-cache-增量构建的黄金组合\">Remote Cache + 增量构建的黄金组合</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 完整优化示例&#10;jobs:&#10;  ci:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    env:&#10;      TURBO_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.TURBO_TOKEN }}&#10;      TURBO_TEAM: ${{ vars.TURBO_TEAM }}&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          fetch-depth: 0&#10;&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v3&#10;        with:&#10;          version: 8&#10;&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: 20&#10;          cache: pnpm # 缓存 node_modules&#10;&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;&#10;      # 增量构建 + Remote Cache（Turborepo 会自动使用 TURBO_TOKEN）&#10;      - run: turbo run build test lint --filter=&#39;...[origin/${{ github.base_ref }}]&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 完整优化示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  ci</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      TURBO_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.TURBO_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      TURBO_TEAM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ vars.TURBO_TEAM }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          fetch-depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 缓存 node_modules</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 增量构建 + Remote Cache（Turborepo 会自动使用 TURBO_TOKEN）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">turbo run build test lint --filter='...[origin/${{ github.base_ref }}]'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>组合效果：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>未变更包</strong>：Remote Cache 命中，零重新执行</li>\n<li><strong>受影响包</strong>：正常执行，结果写入 Remote Cache 供后续复用</li>\n<li><strong>全新包</strong>：完整执行</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"ci-时间诊断与优化\">CI 时间诊断与优化</h2><h3 id=\"识别-ci-瓶颈\">识别 CI 瓶颈</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Turborepo：生成详细执行报告&#10;turbo build --summarize&#10;&#10;# Nx：查看任务时间线&#10;nx show run-summaries --base=origin/main\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Turborepo：生成详细执行报告</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">turbo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --summarize</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Nx：查看任务时间线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> show</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run-summaries</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --base=origin/main</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"常见优化点\">常见优化点</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>诊断方法</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TypeScript 编译慢</td>\n<td>检查 <code>tsc</code> 耗时</td>\n<td>使用 <code>tsc --build</code> + 项目引用增量编译；或切换到 SWC/esbuild</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>test 耗时</td>\n<td>检查 test 任务时长</td>\n<td>增加 <code>--parallel</code>；分片；使用 Vitest（比 Jest 快 5-10x）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全量构建（非增量）</td>\n<td>检查 filter 是否生效</td>\n<td>确认 <code>fetch-depth: 0</code>；检查是否有全局文件触发全量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安装耗时</td>\n<td>检查 <code>pnpm install</code> 时长</td>\n<td>使用 <code>--frozen-lockfile</code>；缓存 node_modules</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cache MISS 频繁</td>\n<td>查看 turbo 日志</td>\n<td>精细化 inputs 配置；排除无关文件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>CI 优化是一个分层递进的过程，从高价值到低价值依次实施：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>受影响分析 + Remote Cache 是 CI 优化的最大杠杆</strong>，往往可以将 CI 时间减少 70-90%</li>\n<li><strong>正确配置 <code>fetch-depth: 0</code></strong> 是增量构建能够正确工作的前提</li>\n<li><strong>并行度设置应基于 Runner 的 CPU 配置</strong>，过高会导致内存竞争和上下文切换开销</li>\n<li><strong>CI 分片适合</strong>已充分利用单 Runner 并行度后仍有性能需求的场景</li>\n<li><strong>Nx Cloud DTE 是超大型 Monorepo 的银弹</strong>：任务调度由 Nx Cloud 完成，无需手动管理分片</li>\n<li><strong>定期审查 CI 时间</strong>：随着 Monorepo 规模增长，需要持续调整优化策略</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>本章节相关文档：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"code-ownership-boundaries\">代码所有权与边界</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"migration-strategies\">迁移策略</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CI 优化策略：分片、并行与增量构建","id":"ci-优化策略-分片-并行与增量构建"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Monorepo CI 的性能挑战","id":"monorepo-ci-的性能挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"增量构建策略","id":"增量构建策略"},{"level":3,"text":"pnpm filter + Turborepo 组合","id":"pnpm-filter-turborepo-组合"},{"level":3,"text":"Nx affected 组合","id":"nx-affected-组合"},{"level":3,"text":"增量构建的正确 git checkout 配置","id":"增量构建的正确-git-checkout-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"任务并行化","id":"任务并行化"},{"level":3,"text":"同一 Runner 内并行","id":"同一-runner-内并行"},{"level":2,"text":"CI 分片策略","id":"ci-分片策略"},{"level":3,"text":"基于 matrix 的手动分片","id":"基于-matrix-的手动分片"},{"level":3,"text":"Nx Cloud 分布式任务执行（推荐）","id":"nx-cloud-分布式任务执行-推荐"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存与构建产物管理","id":"缓存与构建产物管理"},{"level":3,"text":"Remote Cache + 增量构建的黄金组合","id":"remote-cache-增量构建的黄金组合"},{"level":2,"text":"CI 时间诊断与优化","id":"ci-时间诊断与优化"},{"level":3,"text":"识别 CI 瓶颈","id":"识别-ci-瓶颈"},{"level":3,"text":"常见优化点","id":"常见优化点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"版本管理与发布：Changesets、Lerna 与 semantic-release","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/code-quality/versioning-publishing"},"next":{"title":"代码所有权与边界：CODEOWNERS 与模块边界约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/scaling/code-ownership-boundaries"}}